{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260921225152_a527a63b","chunk_index":18,"job_id":"mwjob_bf28987c132c1b13527f252a","precondition_digest":"67d537499c47fe4ae0d786ec4ac18714b2af7d64fc584e8f1b34e1d9f712899a","project_id":"proj_user_8a5a00cb014a","schema_version":"protocol_full_draft_chunk_v5","section_ids":["mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_0a9e98cb500d9ec5","mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_69c81a8357089814","mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_cb95bcbc11a174bb","mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_df24f522766abc57"],"sections":[{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260921225152_a527a63b","content_status":"decision_required","decision_items":[{"blocking_section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_0a9e98cb500d9ec5","fact_path":"design.center_model","options":[{"label":"牵头中心审查、其他中心认可或备案","option_id":"lead_ec_with_site_recognition","summary":"由牵头中心伦理委员会审查，其他参加中心按所在地要求完成认可或备案。"},{"label":"各中心分别审查","option_id":"site_by_site_ec","summary":"各参加中心分别提交本中心伦理委员会审查并取得同意。"},{"label":"区域伦理委员会审查","option_id":"regional_ec","summary":"采用区域伦理委员会审查，并完成各中心要求的确认程序。"}],"question":"多中心研究采用何种伦理审查路径？","rationale":"项目已确认为多中心设计，伦理审查路径影响方案实施与提交安排，需在定稿前明确；正文未预设具体路径。","recommended_option_id":"lead_ec_with_site_recognition"},{"blocking_section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_0a9e98cb500d9ec5","fact_path":"framing.development_regions","options":[{"label":"写入一般性条款","option_id":"general_clause","summary":"仅说明按伦理委员会审查决定及适用法规要求执行，不展开步骤与分工。"},{"label":"写入具体执行条款","option_id":"detailed_clause","summary":"明确触发情形、执行步骤与记录要求，需先完成项目决策。"},{"label":"依托中心标准操作规程","option_id":"defer_to_site_sop","summary":"方案正文不展开，按各中心标准操作规程执行。"}],"question":"是否在本章节写入伦理委员会要求暂停或终止研究、或要求受试者退出研究时的处理要求？","rationale":"允许来源仅提供伦理委员会要求终止研究或受试者退出的共性表述，缺少本项目执行程序；推荐仅写一般性条款，避免预设未确认的程序。","recommended_option_id":"general_clause"}],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_d2ecb6f405c5f941:full-draft:0eab252ef8e77acdda3d5285","quote":"SECTION_ID=mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_0a9e98cb500d9ec5\n章节编号=11.3\n章节标题=伦理委员会\n章节类型=section\n当前正文=（当前为空，需生成实质正文）","quote_sha256":"aec90105eab56dd6228deca3b6a44339c2754c55a1db35cc8c8845f0324bae60","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:0eab252ef8e77acdda3d5285","span_id":"sel_113"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"中心模式：多中心","quote_sha256":"2cfa68bc992967c797bbd3113b5e0d0844d660a2050095a31f08358c5e40311f","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"def_center"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"研究分期：III期\n开发区域：中国","quote_sha256":"e020d2c159e11fc2256b34e32d1dc5b712b00e95f371718d014f4c1f1208edb9","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"def_phase_region"},{"locator":"section:4.3 终止研究标准|block:850|chunk:1","quote":"行政管理部门或伦理委员会（EC）要求终止研究；","quote_sha256":"f19661bef01070eab86ff5119d563d2a2c9cec40e46037583009193ebb9b3555","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:2db65207908661","span_id":"ec_term_mgk10"},{"locator":"section:终止研究|block:316|chunk:1","quote":"药政管理部门或伦理委员会要求终止研究；","quote_sha256":"057bf321f30180105f30781bb0d989a31b06495a3236bef84c0c313958c0fa80","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:72548c417a8f5c","span_id":"ec_term_134"},{"locator":"section:3.5.4 提前退出研究|block:556|chunk:1","quote":"研究者、申办者、伦理委员会/机构委员会因安全性、监管或其他原因要求受试者退出研究。","quote_sha256":"3c04b77ba21334b1f8bd03c450ef947382ab158a7062d8441c012b4d74077fc7","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:4e86a5ea954c95","span_id":"ec_withdraw_mgk10"},{"locator":"section:8.研究者、申办者、伦理委员会/机构委员会因安全性、监管或其他原因要求试验参与者退出研究。|block:328|chunk:1","quote":"8.研究者、申办者、伦理委员会/机构委员会因安全性、监管或其他原因要求试验参与者退出研究。","quote_sha256":"d5df3f4866c67ed3d53fc05c1c65b34556cf4cd8587f487df447908c0ede9117","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:df064f51d3d147","span_id":"ec_withdraw_134"}],"evidence_span_ids":["sel_113","def_center","def_phase_region","ec_term_mgk10","ec_term_134","ec_withdraw_mgk10","ec_withdraw_134"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":4,"project_fact_spans":2},"heading":"伦理委员会","missing_source_classes":[],"proposal_text":"本研究为在中国开展的多中心临床研究，研究的实施以伦理审查同意为前提。研究开始前，研究方案、知情同意文件及其他需要审查的材料应提交伦理委员会审查，经同意后方可开展研究。研究过程中，研究方案及其修正案、知情同意文件及其变更，以及对受试者安全与权益可能产生实质影响的信息，应按要求提交伦理委员会审查；研究的实施过程接受伦理委员会的监督。与伦理审查相关的具体程序、提交时点及沟通安排，按适用法规要求和伦理委员会意见执行。","rationale":"正文以已确认的项目特征（中国、多中心）为背景，写明伦理审查同意后方可实施、方案及知情同意文件变更须经审查、研究实施接受伦理委员会监督。医学作者需确认多中心伦理审查路径、提交与沟通安排，以及是否写入伦理委员会要求暂停或终止研究、要求受试者退出时的处理条款。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_0a9e98cb500d9ec5","section_number":"11.3","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:0eab252ef8e77acdda3d5285","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:2db65207908661","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:72548c417a8f5c","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:4e86a5ea954c95","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:df064f51d3d147","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:342cfc57d67b67"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260921225152_a527a63b","content_status":"decision_required","decision_items":[{"blocking_section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_69c81a8357089814","fact_path":"framing.development_regions","options":[{"label":"原则性条款","option_id":"principles_only","summary":"正文仅写明按适用法律法规和伦理要求处理，具体方式由项目文件另行规定。"},{"label":"明确编码与去标识化方式","option_id":"coding_spec","summary":"在方案中写明受试者编码规则与数据标识要求。"},{"label":"参照牵头中心统一要求","option_id":"lead_center_policy","summary":"由牵头中心统一规定个人信息处理与数据管理要求。"}],"question":"受试者个人信息保护与数据去标识化的具体要求如何确定？","rationale":"允许来源未包含本项目个人信息保护与去标识化的具体安排，需医学作者确认后再细化。","recommended_option_id":"principles_only"},{"blocking_section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_69c81a8357089814","fact_path":"design.center_model","options":[{"label":"原则性表述","option_id":"general","summary":"仅限定为因研究需要并经授权的人员，不列具体岗位或清单。"},{"label":"按中心分别明确","option_id":"per_center","summary":"按研究中心分别明确可接触资料的人员类别与审批方式。"},{"label":"并入数据管理程序","option_id":"data_program","summary":"方案正文不展开，由数据管理与质量控制程序文件规定。"}],"question":"多中心研究中的数据与资料接触、流转安排如何在保密要求中体现？","rationale":"项目为多中心设计，资料接触与流转的具体安排尚未确定，需医学作者确认。","recommended_option_id":"general"}],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_d2ecb6f405c5f941:full-draft:0eab252ef8e77acdda3d5285","quote":"SECTION_ID=mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_69c81a8357089814\n章节编号=11.4\n章节标题=保密与隐私\n章节类型=section\n当前正文=（当前为空，需生成实质正文）","quote_sha256":"741be8121beaf36f5a848c4dd59b2aa723c79ac56a7dd5d068cfddcf38f117c3","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:0eab252ef8e77acdda3d5285","span_id":"sel_114"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"中心模式：多中心","quote_sha256":"2cfa68bc992967c797bbd3113b5e0d0844d660a2050095a31f08358c5e40311f","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"def_center"},{"locator":"section:文档开头|block:4|chunk:1","quote":"本方案中所包含的所有信息归申办方所有，因此，仅提供给研究者、合作研究者、伦理委员会和监督管理部门等相关机构进行审阅。在未得到申办方书面批准的情况下，除了在与可能参加本研究的受试者签署知情同意书时，向其做必要的解释外，严禁将任何信息告知与本研究无关的第三方。","quote_sha256":"dfc9fceb41db9d941df0e3715483adaa069da4f1953600a6a37a56d7f81373dd","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:342cfc57d67b67","span_id":"conf_my4567"}],"evidence_span_ids":["sel_114","def_center","conf_my4567"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":1,"project_fact_spans":1},"heading":"保密与隐私","missing_source_classes":[],"proposal_text":"受试者隐私保护与研究信息保密是本研究实施的基本要求。研究实施过程中，受试者的个人信息及研究相关记录应按照适用法律法规和伦理要求进行收集、使用与保管，研究资料与数据的接触范围限定为因研究需要并经授权的人员。包含受试者身份信息的记录不得公开或向无关人员传播，研究结果发表及对外交流时应避免直接识别受试者身份。研究方案及研究相关信息属于保密资料，仅在必要范围内提供给因研究需要及依法有权审阅的机构；除上述情形外的对外提供或披露，按适用要求履行相应程序后执行。","rationale":"正文以已确认的多中心设计为背景，按适用法律法规与伦理要求写明个人信息与记录的保管、资料接触范围限定、结果公开时的隐私保护以及保密资料的对外提供原则。医学作者需确认个人信息保护框架、数据去标识化方式，以及资料接触与对外披露的具体范围与程序。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_69c81a8357089814","section_number":"11.4","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:0eab252ef8e77acdda3d5285","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:2db65207908661","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:72548c417a8f5c","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:4e86a5ea954c95","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:df064f51d3d147","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:342cfc57d67b67"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260921225152_a527a63b","content_status":"source_gap","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[],"evidence_span_ids":[],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":0},"heading":"保险与赔偿","missing_source_classes":["申办方保险凭证或保险合同","受试者损害赔偿与医疗处理安排文件","适用地区临床试验保险相关监管要求"],"proposal_text":"","rationale":"现有允许来源未包含本项目保险与赔偿相关信息（保险责任、赔偿范围、处理流程），无法在不臆造的前提下形成正文；需补充申办方保险凭证、损害赔偿安排或适用监管要求等来源，由医学作者确认后形成正文。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_cb95bcbc11a174bb","section_number":"11.5","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:0eab252ef8e77acdda3d5285","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:2db65207908661","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:72548c417a8f5c","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:4e86a5ea954c95","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:df064f51d3d147","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:342cfc57d67b67"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260921225152_a527a63b","content_status":"source_gap","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[],"evidence_span_ids":[],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":0},"heading":"研究文件、监查和管理","missing_source_classes":["监查计划及监查实施要求文件","研究文件记录、归档与保存要求","数据管理与质量控制程序文件"],"proposal_text":"","rationale":"现有允许来源仅确认依从性通过药品计数及受试者日记评价，未提供研究文件管理、监查实施与数据管理职责的程序性要求，无法形成可审阅正文；需补充监查计划、文件归档保存要求及数据管理程序等来源后由医学作者确认。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_df24f522766abc57","section_number":"12","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:0eab252ef8e77acdda3d5285","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:2db65207908661","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:72548c417a8f5c","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:4e86a5ea954c95","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:df064f51d3d147","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:342cfc57d67b67"]}],"source_bindings":[{"locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_d2ecb6f405c5f941:full-draft:0eab252ef8e77acdda3d5285","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:0eab252ef8e77acdda3d5285","source_type":"protocol_full_draft_selection","text_sha256":"3d9f17216edd35a8c6ddcc6b2d4c6732dc7c919c9958fb6d4c44cda9cf5bda81"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","source_type":"current_project_study_definition","text_sha256":"787313a6f081b1c9afdf03800feb1c50c317aa4aa4f0c3884e924b0594e666da"},{"locator":"section:4.3 终止研究标准|block:850|chunk:1","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:2db65207908661","source_type":"company_protocol_reference_corpus","text_sha256":"f19661bef01070eab86ff5119d563d2a2c9cec40e46037583009193ebb9b3555"},{"locator":"section:终止研究|block:316|chunk:1","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:72548c417a8f5c","source_type":"company_protocol_reference_corpus","text_sha256":"057bf321f30180105f30781bb0d989a31b06495a3236bef84c0c313958c0fa80"},{"locator":"section:3.5.4 提前退出研究|block:556|chunk:1","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:4e86a5ea954c95","source_type":"company_protocol_reference_corpus","text_sha256":"3c04b77ba21334b1f8bd03c450ef947382ab158a7062d8441c012b4d74077fc7"},{"locator":"section:8.研究者、申办者、伦理委员会/机构委员会因安全性、监管或其他原因要求试验参与者退出研究。|block:328|chunk:1","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:df064f51d3d147","source_type":"company_protocol_reference_corpus","text_sha256":"d5df3f4866c67ed3d53fc05c1c65b34556cf4cd8587f487df447908c0ede9117"},{"locator":"section:文档开头|block:4|chunk:1","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:342cfc57d67b67","source_type":"company_protocol_reference_corpus","text_sha256":"dfc9fceb41db9d941df0e3715483adaa069da4f1953600a6a37a56d7f81373dd"}]}